{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10249","headline":"送韦侍御奉使江岭诸道催青苗钱 · 包何","name":"送韦侍御奉使江岭诸道催青苗钱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近远从王事，南行处处经。\n手持霜简白，心在夏苗青。\n回鴈书应报，愁猨夜屡听。\n因君使绝域，方物尽来庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包何","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}